 **Parameters:**
-*   $L_{max}$: The maximum SH degree supported by the representation (e.g., $L_{max}=3$ or $4$).
+*   $L_{max}$: The maximum SH degree supported by the representation (e.g., $L_{max}=3$ or $4$) [S1, S2].
